{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56353","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 慎独二章（一章十句，一章八句）（慎独，闭邪存其诚也。） 一 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 慎独二章（一章十句，一章八句）（慎独，闭邪存其诚也。） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恐惧不覩，诫慎不闻。\n我公慎独，於斯洞分。\n微既莫显，隐何可云？\n温树奚问，谏草自焚。\n克谨天戒，允符帝文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}